  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Macro - Technical Assistance Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance (TA) facility focussed on supporting priority Government of Iraq (GoI) economic reform initiatives. The anticipated impact of this component would be to: improve and support GoI economic policies, with a focus on private and financial sector reform; improve GoI economic governance; improve effectiveness of public sector institutions; improve public finance management; and, improve business infrastructure. TA that supports gender and climate objectives, alongside economic development will be prioritised, with assessment of gender and climate impacts integrated into each TA proposal.</narrative>
  </description>
